# bat config - synced via `stow bat`. Each line is a bat command-line argument.

# Catppuccin Mocha is bundled in bat (no theme file to stow) and matches delta's
# diff theme. bat otherwise defaults to Monokai.
--theme="Catppuccin Mocha"

# Page through moor (a modern less). --no-linenumbers avoids doubling bat's own
# line numbers; --quit-if-one-screen mirrors bat's default less -F behaviour.
# moor is bat's pager only, not the global PAGER: git pages through delta and
# man keeps less.
--pager="moor --no-linenumbers --quit-if-one-screen"
